# Box tiers (B1): only the sunny box at first; beyond the fence brings the sunset box (it pops in
# with a "new!" tag until you buy one), a sunset box holds 2-3 pets (the ritual for the best one,
# the rest are "also inside"), your pet's job card gets a switch per tier, and all three tiers fit.
from rich
view full
stickers off
tab boxes
expect fits
expect no-text "sunset box"
shot sunny_only
find intel_fence
wait popup
click "lovely"
wait text "new boxes!*"
wait 1.5
expect text "sunset box"
expect text "new!"
expect fits
shot sunset_new
coins 100000
click name:amount_sunset_10
click name:buy_sunset
expect pile sunset 10
expect no-text "new!"
teach boxes
wait 0.5
expect text "opening boxes"
click name:let_sunset
wait 0.3
shot job_card
click name:let_sunset
click name:open_sunset_1
key space
wait ritual
expect text "also inside"
expect fits
shot also_inside
click "lovely!"
expect pile sunset 9
click name:open_sunset_all
wait 5
shot many
click "lovely!"
expect pile sunset 0
unlock feature:shopping
tiers all
wait 1.5
expect text "midnight box"
expect fits
shot three_tiers
